    "title": "Locate things relative to other things",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-spatial-relations-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Locate things relative to other things",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put a location word after a reference place to say inside, outside, in front or behind. Establish what the position is relative to.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他在学校前面。",
                "pinyin": "tā zài xuéxiào qiánmiàn 。",
                "meaning": "He is in front of the school.",
                "audio": "82c7ff7c0d94ba026f5ab78fb2aa3e48eacec8e2cf2863be2a6891eb075672f7"
              },
              {
                "text": "他在学校后面。",
                "pinyin": "tā zài xuéxiào hòumiàn 。",
                "meaning": "He is behind the school.",
                "audio": "4995c3fb7813af469725cbbad61c1abf217f3cb2667d22d66f4f9dc9834dfe88"
              }
            ]
          },
